            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before the new one: say the Tamil for a robot, then the Tamil for artificial."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ஒலிபெருக்கி",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ஒலிபெருக்கி — oliperukki — \"a loudspeaker\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "கோயில் திருவிழாவில் ஒலிபெருக்கி மிகவும் சத்தமாக இருந்தது. kōyil tiruviḻāvil oliperukki mikavum cattamāka iruntatu. At the temple festival the loudspeaker was very loud."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ஒலி \"sound\" + பெருக்கி \"that which multiplies\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ஒலிபெருக்கி (oliperukki) is a modern native compound: ஒலி (oli), \"sound\", and பெருக்கி (perukki), \"that which makes it great\", from பெரு (peru), \"great\" (DEDR 4411)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for describing what you lived and felt."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 4,
          "type": "guided-production",
          "title": "Guided Practice",
          "segments": [
